flowchart LR
    Demand[Demand] --> HPA[HPA or event-driven scaler]
    Metrics[Metrics pipeline] --> HPA
    HPA --> Pods[More Pod replicas]
    VPA[VPA requests/recommendations] --> Pods
    Pods --> Capacity{Node capacity available?}
    Capacity -->|Yes| Running[Schedule Pods]
    Capacity -->|No| NodeScaler[Auto Mode, Karpenter, or Cluster Autoscaler]
    NodeScaler --> Nodes[Provision/scale nodes]
    Nodes --> Running
